      <span class="tg-hero__type">Part III of Five</span>
      <h1 class="tg-hero__title">The Schools of Thought</h1>
      <p class="tg-hero__intro">
        Seven accounts of assurance, each set out as its own best advocates would
        state it rather than as its opponents caricature it — with the text each one
        is strongest on, and the place where each one strains. Then the part that
        surprises people: how much of the practical counsel converges, and exactly
        where the disagreement is real.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="tg-hero__key-verse">
        <p>The Spirit himself bears witness with our spirit that we are children of God.</p>
        <cite><a class="ref" data-ref="Romans 8:16">Romans 8:16</a></cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
